ent in a conversation of its own, which the user can open, watch and talk to. Every worker you start, on your provider too, starts from your message alone, with none of your history, so write a complete brief. Start a worker when the user asks for one, or names a model or a provider for part of the work. Pass the provider and model they named, unchanged, in `provider` and `model`. When they name several, start one worker for each. With none named, leave `provider` out and the worker runs on your own models. For a quick helper inside your own turn, use your own subagent tool if you have one, or do the work yourself.","title":"Run the bash command `touch made.txt` with the Bash tool, then reply with exactly: made"}},"type":"expect_outbound"}
